          "title": "BGP Basics and Autonomous Systems",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. AS and Path-Vector",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==AS== = networks under one policy, ID'd by an ==ASN==",
                "IGP (OSPF) routes {blue:inside} an AS; BGP routes {green:between} ASes",
                "BGP carries the internet's routing table",
                "==Path-vector== over TCP ==179==, neighbours set by hand",
                "Prefixes carry attributes",
                "Own ASN already in `AS_PATH` → route rejected (loops)"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. eBGP, iBGP, Best Path",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
