              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Config and Check",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Declare local AS, name the peer and its AS, then advertise a prefix",
                "`network` only advertises a prefix already in the routing table",
                "Verify `show ip bgp summary`: ==number in State/PfxRcd== ok; Idle/Active = TCP or config fault"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "cisco",
              "lines": [
                "router bgp 65001",
                " neighbor 203.0.113.2 remote-as 65002",
                " network 198.51.100.0 mask 255.255.255.0"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
